{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46974","headline":"寄武陵贯微上人二首 一 · 齐己","name":"寄武陵贯微上人二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知泛沧浪櫂未还，西峰房锁夜潺潺。\n春陪相府游仙洞，雪共宾寮对玉山。\n诗里几添新菡萏，衲痕应换旧斓斑。\n莫忘一句曹溪妙，堪塞孙孙骋度关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}